  "description": "From TASK-12.10 (doc-188, judge J-2-01 MEDIUM). With an old-version connection blocking the upgrade, the first app tab rejects with UpgradeBlockedError, but a second app tab opened in the same browser stays on the loading Home menu with no error until the blocker closes: its open request queues behind the first tab's blocked request and never gets its own blocked event. Also bundles small cleanups: docs/storage/hand-records.md version table says 4 while DB_VERSION is 5; in src/storage/hand-store.ts the redundant blockedOpen reset (~:262), the dead db===opening guard (~:268) and an unwrapped 170-char docblock line (~:240).",
